#Claude
# Exclude .claude/ CONTENTS (not the dir itself — required for the negation below to
# reach inside; `.claude/` with trailing slash would block negations).
.claude/*
# FUP-0815: tracked-carve-out for operator-scribe slash-commands (\btw etc.)
# The .claude/commands/ subtree contains intentional, shareable scribe slash-commands
# (CC has zero discretion; orchestrator obeys operator intent transcribed by CC).
# All other .claude/ contents (session state, auth tokens, etc.) remain excluded.
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/commands/**
